Hi folks,

This is it. I was killed many times in any ways but this is too much.

Alas: Nethack proved its cold cruelty again:

Schwertleite the Valkyrie (yup, right out of Wagner's opera :-) had just
started to explore the dungeons of danger when she found a handy altar.
"Well, Odin my father, help thy child in this hour of need!" she implored
and Odin answered her calls by sending her the sword of power: Stormy himself.

All went well until just in the next level she found a ragged piece of paper.
Jesting with her faithful dog she said: "Curiosity killed the cat..."
and read the thing.  ZAAAPPPP FLASH ... she opened her eyes only to find
herself locked in a small room with gold.

To make a long story short: One can survive on guards and prayers, but
without a pickaxe or a means to teleport out this is worse than death:
Actually doing time in prison. FOR LIFE!!



